  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Feasibilitystudie g&#xe4;llande rehabiliteringsprojekt av Vilnius fj&#xe4;rr- v&#xe4;rmeverk. Studien inkluderar en teknisk del som analyserar det nuvarande l&#xe4;get och villkor f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar vad g&#xe4;ller  fj&#xe4;rrv&#xe4;rmesystemet i omr&#xe5;det och en mer finansiell/institutionell del. Svensk part &#xe4;r &#xc5;F International. Sida-st&#xf6;d: SEK 7 385 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibilitystudy concerning the District Heating Rehabilitation project. The study includes a technical part which will present the status and scope for improvement of the heating service, and a financial/institutional part. Swedish counterpart is &#xc5;F International. The total Sida-contribution amounts to SEK 7 385 000.</narrative>
  </description>
